{"overview":"سوزومه، ۱۷ ساله، مادرش را وقتی کودک بود از دست داد. در راه مدرسه با مرد جوانی مرموز ملاقات می‌کند؛ اما کنجکاوی او فاجعه‌ای را برمی‌انگیزد که تمام جمعیت ژاپن را تهدید می‌کند و سوزومه برای درست کردن اوضاع سفری را آغاز می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Suzume, 17, lost her mother as a little girl. On her way to school, she meets a mysterious young man. But her curiosity unleashes a calamity that endangers the entire population of Japan, and so Suzume embarks on a journey to set things right.","tagline_en":"On the other side of the door, was time in its entirety.","runtime":122,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ماکوتو شینکای"],"crew_en":["Makoto Shinkai"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"原菜乃華","role":"Suzume Iwato (voice)","photo":"/gbK8GbkeOvd1ZdYoxkEajYvXFjI.jpg","en":"Nanoka Hara"},{"name":"松村北斗","role":"Souta Munakata (voice)","photo":"/rtdHPwvoSel4m4CbJwZgcfnFsA0.jpg","en":"Hokuto Matsumura"},{"name":"深津絵里","role":"Tamaki Iwato (voice)","photo":"/xlSYQwDHZaXRFVh29JfRlu4EedP.jpg","en":"Eri Fukatsu"},{"name":"شوتا سومتانی","role":"Minoru Okabe (voice)","photo":"/sEEfyEfEbd9TQB9gFlvDTQJov76.jpg","en":"Shota Sometani"},{"name":"伊藤沙莉","role":"Rumi Ninomiya (voice)","photo":"/5E66xtBsjyL7mgfWxEdNJsDLZnb.jpg","en":"Sairi Ito"},{"name":"花瀬琴音","role":"Chika Amabe (voice)","photo":"/xSimDM5cdwBtVAa7FJ36gFyMC0p.jpg","en":"Kotone Hanase"},{"name":"花澤香菜","role":"Tsubame Iwato (voice)","photo":"/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg","en":"Kana Hanazawa"},{"name":"二代目 松本白鸚","role":"Hitsujiro Munakata (voice)","photo":"/hvY9r6exOHiBC1LmsOXelB5Sat8.jpg","en":"Matsumoto Hakuō II"},{"name":"神木隆之介","role":"Tomoya Serizawa (voice)","photo":"/ut7ewXjdgUmgkhJ1EtbOo9tbc7s.jpg","en":"Ryunosuke Kamiki"},{"name":"山根あん","role":"Daijin (voice)","photo":"/q2uQ09AxnLUy07zR7XEJOvc8hJf.jpg","en":"Ann Yamane"},{"name":"三浦あかり","role":"Young Suzume Iwato (voice)","photo":"/4Nb1EJwmp2fFvpmlO2154Y0aBPW.jpg","en":"Akari Miura"},{"name":"上田燿司","role":"(voice)","photo